              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MirthRoast1859"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great, i roasted the spice mix before adding, added 2 finely sliced chillies and a titch more sugar as my vinegar was a bit too astringent. Great chutney to preserve cherries! Thanks",
