            },
            "reviewBody": "Browned chicken thighs.. With salt and pepper.. Poured.the chutney on top.. With a little chYicken broth.. Baked for 57 minutes at 375.. In the frying pan.. Out of this world.. I used wine vinegar and rice vinegar",
