              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Karla Kobayashi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made it with Bing cherries and substituted the Chinese Five Spice for Curry powder. Came out a beautiful golden color. It was kinda soupy though so I added some cornstarch to thicken it a little...I guess I could have added a touch of pectin but I wasn't looking for a jam like consistency. Tasted yummy",
            "datePublished": "2017-06-18T17:26:30.330Z"
          },
          {
