            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "stairfamily"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe had tons of great flavor from the fruit and the spices, but we felt it was a bit heavy on the vinegar. When we make it again, we will add 1/4 to 1/2 cup more brown sugar. We also added about an 1/8 teaspoon cardamom. Yum!",
            "datePublished": "2012-11-04T19:43:48.700Z"
